; Regression test for GitHub issue #3314: balanced virtual postings, in
; [brackets], get the allowance for per-unit cost rounding that real
; postings get (#1125).  Each cost rounded to the cent, $2.00 + $7.49,
; comes to the $9.49 written against them.

2015-07-02 Bread budget
    [Budget:Bread]            0.50 bread @ $3.99
    [Budget:Bread]            1.50 bread @ $4.99
    [Budget:Checking]              -$9.49

test bal --flat --no-total Budget:Bread
          2.00 bread  Budget:Bread
end test
